  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 240°C/220°C fan-forced.\n• Meanwhile, cut haloumi into 1cm-thick slices. Place haloumi in a medium bowl and cover with water. Set aside.\n• Cut sweet potato, carrot and beetroot into bite-sized chunks.\n• Finely chop garlic.\n• Zest lemon and cut into wedges.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-66433f7ae2d7ea260ec25140-eee20569.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Place prepped veggies on a lined oven tray.\n• Drizzle with olive oil, sprinkle with garlic & herb seasoning and season with pepper. Toss to coat, then roast until tender, 20-25 minutes. TIP: Beetroot stays firm when cooked. It's done when you can pierce it with a fork.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-66433f7ae2d7ea260ec25140-3df22589.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• When veggies have 5 minutes remaining, drain haloumi and pat dry.\n• Return frying pan to medium-high heat with a drizzle of olive oil. Cook haloumi until golden brown, 1-2 minutes each side.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-66433f7ae2d7ea260ec25140-98e19907.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Reduce to medium heat, in the last minute of cook time, add garlic, the water, honey, a pinch of lemon zest and chilli flakes (if using!) and turn haloumi to coat, until fragrant, 1-2 minutes. TIP: Cook haloumi in batches for best results!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-66433f7ae2d7ea260ec25140-9fa837f9.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• To the tray with the roasted veggies, add baby spinach leaves, a squeeze of lemon juice and a drizzle of white wine vinegar.\n• Gently toss to combine. Season to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-66433f7ae2d7ea260ec25140-5de9fc2b.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Roughly chop roasted almonds.\n• Divide roast veggie toss between plates. Top with sweet and sticky haloumi.\n• Sprinkle with almonds. Serve with a dollop of Greek-style yoghurt and any remaining lemon wedges. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-66433f7ae2d7ea260ec25140-8529a8d7.jpeg"
    }
  ]
